    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1203a0282ff36dc8f1cdc6f3",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……祝您生日快乐。\n瓶中花的标本、和热土所制的杯子……\n您想要哪个？",
